= Boston University Chobanian & Avedisian School of Medicine - Prompt 06

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Safety Net Environment
- Limit: 3000 characters
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024 archive on Admit.org
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/boston-university-school-of-medicine
- Local notes file: prompt-06.local.md

#section_label("Prompt text")
Boston Medical Center is the largest safety net hospital in New England. Why are you specifically interested in beginning your medical education in this environment, and how do you feel that your previous experiences will prepare you for this unique learning environment?

#section_label("Shared backbone files")
- typst/shared/why-school.typ
